 "description": "Introducing the all-new Saffier SL 46 luxury sailing yacht - where stunning sailing performance meets ultimate luxury. This is our new flagship. The Saffier SL 46 has a cockpit designed to be enjoyed sailing. Embrace the outdoors and revel in nature's beauty. This Saffier Yacht has an interior that enables you to sail and adventure like never before. Experience unmatched luxury, performance and style on this Saffier yacht.",
 "credits": [
  {
   "label": "Design",
   "value": "D. Hennevanger | Kees van de Stadt"
  }
 ],
 "awards": [],
 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "A unique sailing experience",
   "intro": "The design and engineering process of this Saffier Yacht started with the creation of the best sailing experience possible.\nThe Saffier SL 46 is an exceptional sailing yacht that is designed and engineered for all types of waters in all types of weather. The SL 46 features a powerful yet easily to control rig and sailplan, ensuring a blend of pure, fast sailing all controlled from the helmsman position.\n\nThe 46-foot luxury sailing yacht can be easily handled by a single person. Navigate the waves and experience the rush as you reach new heights of speed and performance. With its lightweight build hull, this sailing yacht guarantees spectacular performance in all conditions, achieving thrilling speeds upwind or downwind—the Saffier SL 46 ensures a resonant experience for sailing enthusiasts, like every Saffier yacht.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Clean & sophisticated interior",
   "intro": "Experience an unparalleled interior. What sets this sailing yacht apart is our styling, premium fabrics, luxury materials and knowledgable craftsmanship to create a clean yet sophisticated design.\nThis sailing yacht is equipped with a full-size galley, luxurious (day)heads, and three cabins featuring double beds. This Saffier SL 46 sailing yacht ensures luxury, comfort and convenience. This creates an interior that is a desirable place to return to, time and time again.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Your outdoor living space",
   "intro": "The heart of this sailing yacht is the cockpit. She offers an unparalleled space, significantly surpassing other sailing yachts in its size.\nThe cockpit of the Saffier SL 46 was designed as a space to enjoy the outside. This shows in her size, deck lay-out, materials and finish. We believe in creating a space where you can enjoy the beauty of nature and be enthralled by your surroundings alongside your dearest friends and family. The cockpit of this sailing yacht creates a perfect setting for memorable moments whilst sailing at sea.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Two configurable deck layouts",
   "intro": "The design of the Saffier SL 46 provides unlimited possibilities. This type of luxury in combination with sailing is unmatched.\nThis shows in its configuration possibilities of the sailing yacht. Something unique is that the deck lay-out is available in two unique configurations specific to your desires: SL 46 MED or SL 46 NORTH.\n\nThe SL 46 MED boasts movable benches and a low aft deck, transforming the entire cockpit into a relaxing swimming platform—an ideal space for unwinding in stunning bays. On the other hand, the SL 46 NORTH provides a unique advantage with a dinghy garage at the stern, ensuring your dinghy is always ready for use. This allows easy access to remote locations, anchoring, and seamless island or marina exploration. Revel in the additional benefit of an expansive sun platform just aft of the helmsman, making your sailing experience truly extraordinary. You choose the version that suits your lifestyle, wishes and sailing area best. The choice is yours.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Spacious cockpit",
   "intro": "The spacious cockpit offers freedom to move, sail and unwind. With plenty of room to relax or take the helm, this area is designed for comfort and control.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Single-handed operation",
   "intro": "All lines lead to the helm, so you can sail solo with ease. Engineered for control, designed for freedom. This is true single-handed sailing.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "High-end interior finishes",
   "intro": "Step below deck and discover refined craftsmanship. From premium woodwork to sleek details, every finish reflects true sailing luxury.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Convertible aft sundeck",
   "intro": "Relax or sail, your choice. The convertible aft sundeck transforms from a comfortable lounge area to a practical sailing setup in seconds.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  }
 ],
